div.p:
                        Dear {{ object.partner_id.name }},



                        We are pleased to confirm your lease agreement for the following property:



                        Lease Details:


Lease ID: {{ object.name }}

Property: {{ object.property_id.name }}

Unit: {{ object.unit_id.name }}

Start Date: {{ format_date(object.start_date) }}

End Date: {{ format_date(object.end_date) }}

Rent Amount: {{ object.rent_amount }} {{ object.currency_id.symbol }}

Payment Schedule: {{ dict(object._fields['payment_schedule'].selection).get(object.payment_schedule) }}

Security Deposit: {{ object.security_deposit }} {{ object.currency_id.symbol }}



                        Please review the attached lease agreement and keep it for your records.



                        If you have any questions, please contact us at {{ object.company_id.email or object.company_id.phone }}.



                        Thank you,


                        {{ object.company_id.name }}

                        Dear {{ object.partner_id.name }},



                        This is a reminder that your lease agreement is expiring soon:



                        Lease Details:


Lease ID: {{ object.name }}

Property: {{ object.property_id.name }}

Unit: {{ object.unit_id.name }}

End Date: {{ format_date(object.end_date) }}

Days Remaining: {{ object.days_remaining }} days



                        If you wish to renew your lease, please contact us as soon as possible.



                        Thank you,


                        {{ object.company_id.name }}

                        Dear {{ object.partner_id.name }},



                        Your lease agreement has expired:



                        Lease Details:


Lease ID: {{ object.name }}

Property: {{ object.property_id.name }}

Unit: {{ object.unit_id.name }}

End Date: {{ format_date(object.end_date) }}



                        Please contact us to discuss your options regarding the property.



                        Thank you,


                        {{ object.company_id.name }}

                        Dear {{ object.partner_id.name }},



                        This is to inform you that your lease agreement has been terminated:



                        Lease Details:


Lease ID: {{ object.name }}

Property: {{ object.property_id.name }}

Unit: {{ object.unit_id.name }}

Termination Date: {{ format_date(object.termination_date) }}

Reason: {{ object.termination_reason or 'Not specified' }}



                        Please contact us if you have any questions.



                        Thank you,


                        {{ object.company_id.name }}

                        Dear {{ object.partner_id.name }},



                        This is a reminder that you have outstanding payments for your lease:



                        Lease Details:


Lease ID: {{ object.name }}

Property: {{ object.property_id.name }}

Unit: {{ object.unit_id.name }}

Total Due: {{ object.total_due }} {{ object.currency_id.symbol }}

Total Paid: {{ object.total_paid }} {{ object.currency_id.symbol }}

Outstanding: {{ object.total_due - object.total_paid }} {{ object.currency_id.symbol }}



                        Please arrange for payment at your earliest convenience to avoid late fees.



                        Thank you,


                        {{ object.company_id.name }}
